{"id":777017,"title":"01｜探索AI绘画世界：Midjourney入门指南","content":"本文介绍了Midjourney软件的注册流程及基础设置。首先，在Discord官网上下载客户端或登录网页版，注册账号并创建个人服务器。接着，邀请Midjourney机器人加入服务器以开始渲染图片。对于基础设置，通过输入/settings指令调出控制面板，选择合适的模型版本如V6（写实风格）或V5（动漫风格），并调整参数如RAW模式、风格化程度等优化渲染效果。最后，建议根据需求添加不同风格的模型，便于快速切换使用。课程总结强调了掌握注册与基础设置的重要性，并布置了实践作业，要求学员亲自操作体验。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":391709,"user_name":"jsw","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1254723,"ip_address":"广西","ucode":"E3B978CDAAA19F","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/13/25/43/ab300d7c.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1718871929,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100767501,"comment_content":"midjourney要付费","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":390930,"user_name":"徐大雷","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":2548016,"ip_address":"内蒙古","ucode":"4D6F0D4C58CE93","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/26/e1/30/56151c95.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1716780356,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100767501,"comment_content":"老师这个discord是不是需要科学上网?","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1024195,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/a0/c3/c5db35df.jpg","nickname":"石云升","note":"","ucode":"78F1DD33EFD000","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":645815,"discussion_content":"是的。要科学上网","content_length":8,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1716821447,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"广东","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]}]}